{
  "grammar": "html",
  "cohort": [
    "_start_tag_name",
    "_script_start_tag_name",
    "_style_start_tag_name",
    "_end_tag_name",
    "erroneous_end_tag_name",
    "_implicit_end_tag",
    "raw_text",
    "comment"
  ],
  "note": "html's tag stack, its void set, and its `can_contain` table, read out of `tag.h` and written down as rules. The stack is the only memory; everything else the scanner does is a table, and a table can live in a file.",
  "notes": [
    "A mark's kind is the *class* a decision reads, not the tag's enum member: 128 members do not fit a 31-kind bitset, and they do not have to, because a known name's member is a function of its spelling. The classes are disjoint, so one kind per tag is enough.",
    "A tag is remembered folded to upper case, the way `towupper` in `scan_tag_name` folds it, so every comparison here is a folded one. An organ tag is bounded, so a custom name longer than the bound compares on its first bytes; html's own names are short enough that the bound is not reachable by anything but a deliberate one."
  ],
  "asks": "token",
  "kinds": {
    "void": 1,
    "script": 2,
    "style": 3,
    "roots": 4,
    "li": 5,
    "dt_dd": 6,
    "para": 7,
    "colgroup": 8,
    "ruby": 9,
    "optgroup": 10,
    "row": 11,
    "cell": 12,
    "plain": 13,
    "custom": 14
  },
  "probes": {
    "space_name": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)([A-Za-z0-9:-]+)",
    "space_style": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:style)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "self_shut": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)/>",
    "opens_anything": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*<(?![!/])",
    "opens_or_ends": "(?:[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*<(?![!/])|[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*\\z)",
    "blank_to_the_end": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*\\z",
    "shuts_something": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*</([A-Za-z0-9:-]+)",
    "shuts_something_known": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*</(?:(?i:blockquote|figcaption|basefont|colgroup|datalist|fieldset|menuitem|noscript|optgroup|progress|template|textarea|address|article|bgsound|caption|command|details|isindex|picture|section|summary|button|canvas|dialog|figure|footer|header|hgroup|iframe|keygen|legend|nextid|object|option|output|script|select|source|strong|aside|audio|embed|frame|image|input|label|meter|param|small|style|table|tbody|tfoot|thead|title|track|video|abbr|area|base|body|cite|code|data|form|head|html|link|main|mark|math|menu|meta|ruby|samp|slot|span|time|bdi|bdo|col|del|dfn|div|img|ins|kbd|map|nav|pre|rtc|sub|sup|svg|var|wbr|br|dd|dl|dt|em|h1|h2|h3|h4|h5|h6|hr|li|ol|rb|rp|rt|td|th|tr|ul|a|b|i|p|q|s|u)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "comment": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)(<!--(?s:.)*?--+>)",
    "script_body": "(?:[^<]|(?i:<)[^/]|(?i:</)[^Ss]|(?i:</S)[^Cc]|(?i:</SC)[^Rr]|(?i:</SCR)[^Ii]|(?i:</SCRI)[^Pp]|(?i:</SCRIP)[^Tt])*",
    "style_body": "(?:[^<]|(?i:<)[^/]|(?i:</)[^Ss]|(?i:</S)[^Tt]|(?i:</ST)[^Yy]|(?i:</STY)[^Ll]|(?i:</STYL)[^Ee])*",
    "name_void": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:basefont|menuitem|bgsound|command|isindex|keygen|nextid|source|embed|frame|image|input|param|track|area|base|link|meta|col|img|wbr|br|hr)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_script": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:script)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_style": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:style)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_roots": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:body|head|html)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_li": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:li)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_dt_dd": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:dd|dt)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_para": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:p)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_colgroup": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:colgroup)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_ruby": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:rb|rp|rt)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_optgroup": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:optgroup)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_row": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:tr)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_cell": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:td|th)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_plain": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)((?i:blockquote|figcaption|datalist|fieldset|noscript|progress|template|textarea|address|article|caption|details|picture|section|summary|button|canvas|dialog|figure|footer|header|hgroup|iframe|legend|object|option|output|select|strong|aside|audio|label|meter|small|table|tbody|tfoot|thead|title|video|abbr|cite|code|data|form|main|mark|math|menu|ruby|samp|slot|span|time|bdi|bdo|del|dfn|div|ins|kbd|map|nav|pre|rtc|sub|sup|svg|var|dl|em|h1|h2|h3|h4|h5|h6|ol|ul|a|b|i|q|s|u)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "name_custom": "([ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*)([A-Za-z0-9:-]+)",
    "a_known_name": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*(?:(?i:blockquote|figcaption|basefont|colgroup|datalist|fieldset|menuitem|noscript|optgroup|progress|template|textarea|address|article|bgsound|caption|command|details|isindex|picture|section|summary|button|canvas|dialog|figure|footer|header|hgroup|iframe|keygen|legend|nextid|object|option|output|script|select|source|strong|aside|audio|embed|frame|image|input|label|meter|param|small|style|table|tbody|tfoot|thead|title|track|video|abbr|area|base|body|cite|code|data|form|head|html|link|main|mark|math|menu|meta|ruby|samp|slot|span|time|bdi|bdo|col|del|dfn|div|img|ins|kbd|map|nav|pre|rtc|sub|sup|svg|var|wbr|br|dd|dl|dt|em|h1|h2|h3|h4|h5|h6|hr|li|ol|rb|rp|rt|td|th|tr|ul|a|b|i|p|q|s|u)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))",
    "opens_a_li_cannot_hold": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*<(?![!/])(?i:li)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-])",
    "opens_a_dt_dd_cannot_hold": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*<(?![!/])(?i:dd|dt)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-])",
    "opens_a_para_cannot_hold": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*<(?![!/])(?i:blockquote|figcaption|fieldset|address|article|details|section|figure|footer|header|aside|form|main|div|nav|pre|dl|h1|h2|h3|h4|h5|h6|hr|ol|p)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-])",
    "opens_a_colgroup_cannot_hold": "(?:[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*<(?![!/])(?!(?i:col)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-]))[A-Za-z0-9:-]+|[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*\\z)",
    "opens_a_ruby_cannot_hold": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*<(?![!/])(?i:rb|rp|rt)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-])",
    "opens_a_optgroup_cannot_hold": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*<(?![!/])(?i:optgroup)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-])",
    "opens_a_row_cannot_hold": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*<(?![!/])(?i:tr)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-])",
    "opens_a_cell_cannot_hold": "[ \\t\\n\\x0b\\f\\r]*<(?![!/])(?i:td|th|tr)(?![A-Za-z0-9:-])"
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "the_raw_body_of_a_script",
      "note": "Always an answer, never a refusal: a script whose closer never arrives is raw text to the end of the file, which makes an unterminated `<script>` a parsed document rather than a stall. Zero is legal too - `<script></script>` has an empty body - and it is decided by the permission set rather than by the bytes: raw text is the answer exactly where neither tag name is legal.",
      "phase": "inside",
      "when": [
        [
          "wanted",
          "raw_text"
        ],
        [
          "not_wanted",
          "_start_tag_name"
        ],
        [
          "not_wanted",
          "_end_tag_name"
        ],
        [
          "marks.depth",
          ">",
          0
        ],
        [
          "marks.top.kind",
          "in",
          [
            "script"
          ]
        ],
        [
          "probe",
          "script_body"
        ]
      ],
      "then": [
        [
          "emit",
          "raw_text"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the_raw_body_of_anything_else",
      "note": "Always an answer, never a refusal: a script whose closer never arrives is raw text to the end of the file, which makes an unterminated `<script>` a parsed document rather than a stall. Zero is legal too - `<script></script>` has an empty body - and it is decided by the permission set rather than by the bytes: raw text is the answer exactly where neither tag name is legal.",
      "phase": "inside",
      "when": [
        [
          "wanted",
          "raw_text"
        ],
        [
          "not_wanted",
          "_start_tag_name"
        ],
        [
          "not_wanted",
          "_end_tag_name"
        ],
        [
          "marks.depth",
          ">",
          0
        ],
        [
          "marks.top.kind",
          "in",
          [
            "void",
            "style",
            "roots",
            "li",
            "dt_dd",
            "para",
            "colgroup",
            "ruby",
            "optgroup",
            "row",
            "cell",
            "plain",
            "custom"
          ]
        ],
        [
          "probe",
          "style_body"
        ]
      ],
      "then": [
        [
          "emit",
          "raw_text"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "opens_void",
      "note": "Opens an element of class `void`.",
      "phase": "enclosing",
      "when": [
        [
          "wanted",
          "_start_tag_name"
        ],
        [
          "not_wanted",
          "raw_text"
        ],
        [
          "probe",
          "name_void"
        ]
      ],
      "then": [
        [
          "skip",
          [
            "span",
            1
          ]
        ],
        [
          "emit",
          "_start_tag_name",
          [
            "span",
            2
          ]
        ],
        [
          "push",
          "marks",
          "void",
          0,
          [
            "group",
            2
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "opens_script",
      "note": "Opens an element of class `script`.",
